      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Under the provisions of Section 220 of the Judiciary Law, added by Chapter 966 of the Laws of Nineteen hundred seventy-six, certain non-judicial officers and employees of the courts and court-related agencies of the unified court system will become officers or employees of the State as of April 1, 1977; and",
